                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6) The Company and the Union agree, where appropriate, to populate existing Product Development Technician classifications to accommodate personnel transferred to the bargaining unit as a result of this agreement. However, where such a fit does not exist, new classification(s) will need to be generated.",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                853,
