                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7) All employees converted to Bargaining Unit classifications will be credited with Bargaining Unit Seniority equal to their individual benefit dates. The benefit date seniority will be used only in the classification entered as a result of this action. An employee who may later transfer to another job classification will be credited with seniority in accordance with the date they were transferred to the Bargaining Unit, pursuant to this agreement.",
